---
/* src/components/DailyPaperDigest.astro */
---
<section class="paper-digest-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-rule">
      <h2>
        <span class="lang-en">Daily Paper Digest</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">每日论文速递</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-desc lang-en">
      Curated key findings from today's ML publications on Hugging Face. Explore problem breakdowns, innovations, and interactive visualizations.
    </p>
    <p class="section-desc lang-zh">
      今日 Hugging Face 精选机器学习前沿论文及深度解析。探索研究瓶颈、技术创新与交互式原理可视化。
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Controls for date selection -->
  <div class="digest-controls">
    <div class="date-chips">
      <button class="chip active" data-preset-date="2026-07-01">
        <span class="lang-en">Today (July 1, 2026)</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">今日 (2026-07-01)</span>
      </button>
      <button class="chip" data-preset-date="2026-06-30">
        <span class="lang-en">Yesterday (June 30, 2026)</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">昨日 (2026-06-30)</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="custom-date-picker-wrap">
      <span class="date-picker-label lang-en">Or select date:</span>
      <span class="date-picker-label lang-zh">或选择日期：</span>
      <div class="input-container">
        <input type="date" id="digest-custom-date" min="2024-01-01" max="2026-07-01" class="digest-date-input" value="2026-07-01">
        <svg class="calendar-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
          <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
          <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Executive Summary Banner -->
  <div class="exec-summary-card">
    <div class="summary-badge">
      <span class="lang-en">💡 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY</span>
      <span class="lang-zh">💡 今日研究大势</span>
    </div>
    <!-- 2026-07-01 EN/ZH -->
    <div class="summary-text lang-en" id="summary-en-0701">
      Today's publications focus on evaluating and improving LLM capabilities: refining diversity metrics in mathematical reasoning, evaluating world knowledge retention in robotics VLA models, examining grounded word learning limits, distilling multiple domain teachers efficiently, and scaling instruction-based video editing models to complex structural controls.
    </div>
    <div class="summary-text lang-zh" id="summary-zh-0701">
      今日的前沿论文聚焦于评估与提升大语言模型（LLM）能力：细化数学推理中的策略分歧指标、评测机器人VLA模型在微调后的常识遗留、检验具身多模态词汇学习的感知局限、通过在线策略蒸馏高效融合多领域教师模型，以及将指令驱动的视频编辑模型扩展至复杂的空间物理控制。
    </div>
    <!-- 2026-06-30 EN/ZH -->
    <div class="summary-text lang-en hide" id="summary-en-0630">
      Yesterday's publications highlight agent safety and efficiency optimizations: formulating agentic abstention, accelerating video editing inference, scaling MoE agents on long-horizon tasks, testing general computer-use agents, and compressing KV cache adaptively.
    </div>
    <div class="summary-text lang-zh hide" id="summary-zh-0630">
      昨日的前沿论文聚焦于智能体安全与效率优化：形式化智能体在环境受限下的退让决策、加速实时视频编辑推理、在长时序任务上进行混合专家（MoE）能力缩放、评测通用终端使用代理，以及提出无阈值自适应裁剪的 KV 缓存压缩。
    </div>
    <!-- Generic Fallback Banner -->
    <div class="summary-text lang-en hide" id="summary-en-generic">
      Dynamic live digest for the selected date. Showing top ML papers fetched directly from Hugging Face Daily Papers feed.
    </div>
    <div class="summary-text lang-zh hide" id="summary-zh-generic">
      以下为所选日期的动态更新。展示直接从 Hugging Face 每日论文接口获取的前沿机器学习研究。
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="digest-grid">
    <!-- Left Panel: Paper Tabs/Details -->
    <div class="papers-list-panel" id="digest-papers-container">
      <div class="loading-spinner hide" id="digest-loading">
        <div class="spinner"></div>
        <p class="lang-en">Fetching papers from Hugging Face...</p>
        <p class="lang-zh">正在从 Hugging Face 获取论文数据...</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Content Target -->
      <div id="papers-content-target">
        <!-- Rendered statically for SSR but updated dynamically by scripts -->
      </div>
      
      <!-- Pagination Controls -->
      <div class="digest-pagination" id="digest-pagination-controls">
        <button class="pagination-btn" id="prev-page-btn" disabled>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg>
          <span class="lang-en">Prev</span>
          <span class="lang-zh">上一页</span>
        </button>
        <span class="pagination-info" id="pagination-page-info">Page 1 of 2</span>
        <button class="pagination-btn" id="next-page-btn">
          <span class="lang-en">Next</span>
          <span class="lang-zh">下一页</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Panel: Visual Playground -->
    <div class="digest-viz-panel">
      <div class="viz-card-header">
        <span class="lang-en">🎯 INTERACTIVE PRINCIPLE EXPLAINER</span>
        <span class="lang-zh">🎯 交互式原理模拟器</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Viz for Paper 1 -->
      <div class="interactive-viz active" id="viz-paper-1">
        <div class="viz-title-row">
          <h4>
            <span class="lang-en">Surface vs. Strategy Diversity</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">表面多样性 vs. 策略多样性</span>
          </h4>
          <span class="viz-status">Interactive</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viz-math-prompt">
          <span class="lang-en">Solve: $x + y = 10; x - y = 4$</span>
          <span class="lang-zh">求解方程组: $x + y = 10; x - y = 4$</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viz-math-toggle">
          <button class="viz-btn active" data-mode="surface">
            <span class="lang-en">Surface Diversity</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">表面多样性</span>
          </button>
          <button class="viz-btn" data-mode="strategy">
            <span class="lang-en">Strategy Diversity</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">策略多样性</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="math-viz-canvas">
          <div class="math-node root-node">
            <div class="node-label">START</div>
          </div>
          <div class="math-paths-container">
            <svg class="math-lines-svg" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <path class="math-line surface-path p-1" d="M 30,60 C 100,20 150,20 220,20" />
              <path class="math-line surface-path p-2" d="M 30,60 C 100,60 150,60 220,60" />
              <path class="math-line surface-path p-3" d="M 30,60 C 100,100 150,100 220,100" />
              <path class="math-line strategy-path p-4 hide" d="M 30,60 C 100,25 150,25 220,25" />
              <path class="math-line strategy-path p-5 hide" d="M 30,60 C 100,95 150,95 220,95" />
            </svg>
            <div class="math-nodes-col">
              <!-- Surface Nodes -->
              <div class="math-node leaf-node surface-node" style="top: 0px;">
                <span class="lang-en">"Let's add both..." (x=7)</span>
                <span class="lang-zh">"两式相加..." (x=7)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="math-node leaf-node surface-node" style="top: 40px;">
                <span class="lang-en">"Adding these..." (x=7)</span>
                <span class="lang-zh">"累加方程组..." (x=7)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="math-node leaf-node surface-node" style="top: 80px;">
                <span class="lang-en">"By adding them..." (x=7)</span>
                <span class="lang-zh">"由加法消元..." (x=7)</span>
              </div>
              <!-- Strategy Nodes -->
              <div class="math-node leaf-node strategy-node hide" style="top: 5px; border-color: var(--purple);">
                <span class="lang-en"><b>Algebraic Addition</b> (2x=14)</span>
                <span class="lang-zh"><b>代数消元法</b> (2x=14)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="math-node leaf-node strategy-node hide" style="top: 75px; border-color: var(--cyan);">
                <span class="lang-en"><b>Substitution</b> (x=y+4)</span>
                <span class="lang-zh"><b>代入消元法</b> (x=y+4)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="viz-caption lang-en">Notice how surface diversity only changes wording while reusing the same logical path. Strategy diversity uses distinct mathematical routes.</p>
          <p class="viz-caption lang-zh">表面多样性只修改措辞，其实走的是完全一样的逻辑路径。策略多样性则使用了截然不同的数学计算路线。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Viz for Paper 2 -->
      <div class="interactive-viz" id="viz-paper-2">
        <div class="viz-title-row">
          <h4>
            <span class="lang-en">VLA Act2Answer Execution</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">VLA Act2Answer 实操演示</span>
          </h4>
          <span class="viz-status">Interactive</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viz-qa-box">
          <div class="qa-q">
            <span class="lang-en">VLM Query: "Pick the fruit and place in Basket B."</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">VLM 指令：“拿起水果，放入B篮子中。”</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tabletop-stage">
            <div class="tabletop-item item-bread" data-name="Bread">🍞</div>
            <div class="tabletop-item item-apple" data-name="Apple">🍎</div>
            <div class="tabletop-item item-cup" data-name="Cup">🥛</div>
            <div class="target-basket">📥 Basket B</div>
            <div class="vla-robotic-arm"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="layers-activation-view">
          <div class="layer-bar">
            <span>Input VLM (Visual Embed)</span>
            <div class="layer-fill" style="width: 35%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-bar active">
            <span>Middle Layers (Intent Peak)</span>
            <div class="layer-fill" style="width: 90%; background: var(--green);"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-bar">
            <span>Output Layers (Action Head)</span>
            <div class="layer-fill" style="width: 50%; background: var(--purple);"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
          <button class="viz-btn primary-action-btn" id="run-vla-btn">
            <span class="lang-en">Run Tabletop Episode</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">运行桌面动作</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-en">VLA answers queries by executing an action (placing the Apple). Knowledge is strongest in middle layers, then decays as it gets converted into motor coordinates.</p>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-zh">VLA 通过执行动作（移动苹果）来回答问题。常识知识表征在中间层最强，在转化为具体的物理电机控制指令时开始衰减。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Viz for Paper 3 -->
      <div class="interactive-viz" id="viz-paper-3">
        <div class="viz-title-row">
          <h4>
            <span class="lang-en">Perceptual Coherence Embedding Space</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">感知一致性嵌入空间</span>
          </h4>
          <span class="viz-status">Interactive</span>
        </div>
        <div class="embedding-scatter-plot">
          <!-- Background grids and gradients -->
          <div class="embedding-grid"></div>
          
          <!-- Clusters -->
          <div class="embed-cluster" style="top: 15%; left: 15%;" data-name="Tove">
            <div class="cluster-label">Tove (Cat)</div>
            <div class="dot d1"></div><div class="dot d2"></div><div class="dot d3"></div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="embed-cluster" style="top: 60%; left: 70%;" data-name="Jubjub">
            <div class="cluster-label">Jubjub (Bird)</div>
            <div class="dot d1"></div><div class="dot d2"></div><div class="dot d3"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="embed-cluster disjunctive" style="top: 50%; left: 35%;" data-name="Bandersnatch">
            <div class="cluster-label">Bandersnatch (Uncoherent)</div>
            <div class="dot d1" style="transform: translate(-30px, -20px);"></div>
            <div class="dot d2" style="transform: translate(40px, 35px);"></div>
            <div class="dot d3" style="transform: translate(-10px, 45px);"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="slider-control-row">
          <label>
            <span class="lang-en">Perceptual Distance Threshold:</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">感知距离阈值：</span>
            <span id="dist-val">0.5</span>
          </label>
          <input type="range" id="distance-slider" min="0.1" max="1.0" step="0.05" value="0.5" />
        </div>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-en">Move the slider. Coherent categories (Tove, Jubjub) stay unified at low thresholds, while disjointed concepts (Bandersnatch) split apart, showing why they are harder to learn.</p>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-zh">拖动滑块。高一致性类别（Tove、Jubjub）在低阈值下仍能凝聚，而离散性较强的概念（Bandersnatch）则迅速崩解，这揭示了为什么后者极难习得。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Viz for Paper 4 -->
      <div class="interactive-viz" id="viz-paper-4">
        <div class="viz-title-row">
          <h4>
            <span class="lang-en">Multi-Teacher On-Policy Distillation</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">多教师在线蒸馏架构 (MOPD)</span>
          </h4>
          <span class="viz-status">Animated</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mopd-canvas">
          <div class="teachers-group">
            <div class="mopd-node teacher active" id="t-math" data-cap="Math">
              <span class="icon">🧮</span>
              <span class="name">Math Teacher</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mopd-node teacher active" id="t-code" data-cap="Code">
              <span class="icon">💻</span>
              <span class="name">Code Teacher</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mopd-node teacher active" id="t-write" data-cap="Writing">
              <span class="icon">✍️</span>
              <span class="name">Write Teacher</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="student-target-col">
            <div class="mopd-node student">
              <span class="icon">🎓</span>
              <span class="name">Student LLM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="student-caps">
              <div class="cap-meter">
                <span class="cap-lbl">Math</span>
                <div class="cap-bar"><div class="cap-fill" id="cap-math-fill" style="width: 95%;"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="cap-meter">
                <span class="cap-lbl">Coding</span>
                <div class="cap-bar"><div class="cap-fill" id="cap-code-fill" style="width: 92%;"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="cap-meter">
                <span class="cap-lbl">Writing</span>
                <div class="cap-bar"><div class="cap-fill" id="cap-write-fill" style="width: 94%;"></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Connecting particle streams -->
          <div class="particles-overlay"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-en">Click on individual teachers to toggle their contribution. MOPD distills knowledge on student rollouts, allowing the student to retain almost 100% capability from all teachers.</p>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-zh">点击各个教师节点以启用/停用其贡献。MOPD 在学生的主动 rollout 分布上进行对齐蒸馏，从而完美吸纳所有教师的能力。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Viz for Paper 5 -->
      <div class="interactive-viz" id="viz-paper-5">
        <div class="viz-title-row">
          <h4>
            <span class="lang-en">Decoupled Video Editing Branches</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">Goku-Edit 解耦编辑双分支</span>
          </h4>
          <span class="viz-status">Interactive</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="edit-command-input">
          <span class="lang-en">Instruction: "Make the subject leap forward"</span>
          <span class="lang-zh">编辑指令：“使目标物向前跃起”</span>
        </div>

        <div class="goku-split-preview">
          <div class="preview-box">
            <div class="preview-lbl">Structural Mask Branch</div>
            <div class="goku-canvas mask-canvas">
              <div class="animating-silhouette"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="preview-box">
            <div class="preview-lbl">Appearance Main Branch</div>
            <div class="goku-canvas render-canvas">
              <div class="animating-object"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="slider-control-row">
          <label>
            <span class="lang-en">Frame Scrub:</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">帧进进度：</span>
            <span id="frame-val">0</span>
          </label>
          <input type="range" id="frame-scrubber" min="0" max="100" value="0" />
        </div>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-en">Use the frame slider to scrub. The Dedicated Mask Branch handles structural changes (motion trajectory), while the main branch performs photorealistic rendering.</p>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-zh">拖动帧滑块。独立掩码分支（左）掌控被摄物体的位移和结构变化，主渲染分支（右）负责画质重建与光影补完。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Generic Fallback Viz -->
      <div class="interactive-viz" id="viz-generic">
        <div class="viz-title-row">
          <h4>
            <span class="lang-en">Latent Knowledge Mapping</span>
            <span class="lang-zh">潜在知识拓扑映射</span>
          </h4>
          <span class="viz-status">Live</span>
        </div>
        <div class="math-viz-canvas" style="padding: 0.5rem;">
          <canvas id="generic-topology-canvas" width="300" height="170" style="display: block; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 6px; width: 100%; height: 170px;"></canvas>
        </div>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-en">Click on the topology map to excite nodes. This visualization plots dynamically fetched paper categories and keyword relationships in a force-directed model.</p>
        <p class="viz-caption lang-zh">点击拓扑图以激活节点。该图在动态力导向模拟中绘制了所选日期论文特征、类别与关键词之间的关联关系。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  /* Base Layout i18n class helpers */
  html[lang="zh-CN"] .lang-en { display: none !important; }
  html:not([lang="zh-CN"]) .lang-zh { display: none !important; }

  .paper-digest-section {
    padding: 3.5rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.025rem;
    color: var(--muted2);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* Date Controls */
  .digest-controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .date-chips {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .chip {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted2);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .chip:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hi);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .chip.active {
    background: var(--purple-dim);
    border-color: var(--purple);
    color: var(--purple-l);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
  }

  .custom-date-picker-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .date-picker-label {
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .input-container {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .digest-date-input {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.4rem 2.2rem 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    outline: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    width: 120px;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }

  .digest-date-input:focus {
    border-color: var(--purple);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
  }

  .calendar-icon {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Executive Summary Card */
  .exec-summary-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.04) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .summary-badge {
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--cyan-l);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .summary-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* Main Grid */
